# TempoTuner requires no environment variables.
#
# The app is a fully client-side static export — no API keys, no server
# secrets, no build-time configuration. Nothing needs to be set in the
# Cloudflare Pages dashboard.
#
# RAILWAY_ENVIRONMENT is injected automatically by Railway (the fallback
# deployment) and switches next.config.mjs to the standalone server build.
# Never set it manually for Cloudflare or local builds.
